    "longDescription": "Kiro Enterprise is the companion app for Kiro, the AI coding agent, built for enterprise customers who sign in to Kiro with AWS IAM Identity Center. Start sessions, track agent progress in real-time, and review code diffs from your phone.\n\n* Sign in with your organization's AWS IAM Identity Center account\n* Start new coding sessions from any connected repository\n* Track agent progress in real-time\n* Review code diffs inline\n* Manage multiple sessions from a single view\n* Light and dark mode",
